eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ymiyMPhgNxYQ7kNvwH5wWS2&_nc_oc=AdlTxEeJkvDzs88kKhAQD6HEpJcXucYPt8LuqXbPPmX7A_LM13SBDDMAiDp_KjKVLUs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyzxOaqmEViIsPgxgHmI5ipyHseuFlyqipf8_CwN26vGg&oe=69AD50DC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CaZ2l1dnwlgQ7kNvwF2Nvp8&_nc_oc=Adnz8RumY10Kyium1Mp5_-jhof9p9NpcqBb_957zwUCLesUaR4xefMRtBVdvZ-Ix-YQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyK-XvdwLVVz26cB9rHpEBZLNppA3Jo-js33BsH5tAbPg&oe=69AD63A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9zidq0hFwcUQ7kNvwHEYMZU&_nc_oc=AdldxwkArehF59tcDFSwonp4s6xVEicxdpMDOH__A4ZSiaoYEPgmCLHePM7hIfrDSdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzXKgOTy9gRawicHk7tZTp2JX8Q1sdmGNYh8_g_tWATew&oe=69AD57EC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kbLbZUbsIsoQ7kNvwEAuPj7&_nc_oc=AdnvZomVlFqbS56xIQNRAx3F52rUqPRtPsGUP2eZ_Psz_qmv7iIz0B1AiOcPQrfoPxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzGSASLD7DjN5OZ-AmYEknq1w7Nok3NTBMMUlsk3Hf0Zw&oe=69AD5DAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LyalBNg9TBIQ7kNvwGAt4ic&_nc_oc=Adl_x_pJX9OJkCtHGq_N-yqtb1Mp7iQAVgpbLKxxV9wrcvylM4yEo3ge06lVZgzLBBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw65D4bzDMLsmt8wBnZCnmJjc5BkdFwdueKnJ-70wtl8A&oe=69AD7D56"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam